WEBVTT

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:08.310
Hurry it up!

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:11.940
MBI told us to get this construction finished within the week!

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:13.750
Huh?

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:16.400
Hey, over there! Don’t slack off!

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:20.960
What? Alright.

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:24.100
Huh?

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:37.090
I work my ass off until I fall down dead... And now I’m supposed to work extra hard to cover someone ELSE’S ass?

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.260
This freaking sucks.

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:42.110
But wouldn’t you say it’s nice to at least have work to do?

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:43.920
Here’s your lunch.

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:45.740
Kashi-bread again??

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:45.740
Note: “Kashi-bread” is a bread roll filled with something. Either curry or bean paste or pudding…etc. They’re poor man’s food.

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:48.390
Just be grateful it’s not just plain bread.

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:51.210
Well, I’d better be on my way.

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:53.320
Huh? Where’re you going?

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:55.800
Didn’t I tell you this morning?

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:58.750
Today’s the day Sekirei is going to be diagnosed.

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:39.680
Tidal wave!

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:46.390
Impossible…

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:48.220
Not yet there, I see.

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:53.500
Musubi,Here I come.

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:00.720
There. An opening.

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:05.100
That hurrrrts.

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:09.440
Yesterday’s explosion on the bridge was…

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:13.080
…possibly the work of a terrorist group, experts say.

00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:15.750
The MBI corporation announced their theory on the matter.

00:03:16.950 --> 00:03:18.170
And now, next up…

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:21.540
Terrorist?

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:22.780
…Could they mean us?

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:28.110
After all, the president covered up the freezing of the mortgage.

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:31.650
Perhaps the president even did this on purpose to hide things even further…

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:36.230
No… With a personality like that, it’s difficult to believe he would plan that far ahead.

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:40.450
G-Good work, girls.

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:43.760
To think I cannot even touch the landlord..

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:46.050
The landlord is very strong.

00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:48.690
…I see you went all out today again…

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:53.130
You two don’t really have to push yourselves that hard.

00:03:54.020 --> 00:03:56.020
But we want to become stronger!

00:03:58.030 --> 00:04:01.000
That’s because we don’t want to have to face such a difficult battle as the last one.

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:05.180
You girls are all so amazing…

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:08.560
Even though all that hardship just barely ended…

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:17.050
Though I guess one could say it was all my fault to begin with.

00:04:17.960 --> 00:04:20.570
But back then, Kona-chan and the others were smiling!

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:21.190
Eh?

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:25.030
So Onii-chan, I think you did a GOOD thing.

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:29.160
Thank you, Kuu-chan

00:04:29.340 --> 00:04:33.190
She’s right, Mina-tan. You should take more pride in what you do.

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:38.850
Matsu is entirely correct. If it weren’t for you, we wouldn’t have a reason to fight on.

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:42.380
For your sake, Minato, I’ll try harder and harder!

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:44.510
Y-Yeah?

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:46.690
Thanks.

00:04:48.670 --> 00:04:49.380
But what about me?

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:53.680
Isn’t there something… no matter how small, that I can do for them?

00:04:56.870 --> 00:04:59.380
Oh myyy, everyone’s together, I see.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:00.530
Kazehana-San.

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:03.130
We’d better get going or we’ll be late.

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:05.890
“Get going”? But where?

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:09.370
Sekirei Diagnosis?

00:05:09.730 --> 00:05:15.420
MBI is going to conduct physicals on all of its members.

00:05:15.970 --> 00:05:18.460
A-Are all the people affiliated with Sekirei going to be there?

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:22.380
It’s going to meet at a special place and there will be no fighting allowed.

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:24.500
I see.

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:28.780
Well then, we’ll be off.

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:30.330
Good byyyyye!

00:05:31.170 --> 00:05:32.130
Have a nice time.

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:42.080
I wonder if it’s okay that I stayed behind…

00:05:42.430 --> 00:05:48.680
What, whaaaat? Don’t tell me, Mina-tan, you wanted to see them all looking like thiiiiis, and like thaaaat?

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:50.840
No, it’s not that at all.

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:53.850
I’m just worried that something might happen to them.

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:55.760
I want to watch over them.

00:05:56.570 --> 00:05:58.850
Matsu-san, aren’t you going?

00:05:59.140 --> 00:06:02.260
Matsu is currently a fugitive from MBI…

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:03.510
Oh yeah, forgot…

00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:05.350
Why’re you dressed like that??

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:07.900
