00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:09.840
And THAT is… your “disguise”?

00:06:10.070 --> 00:06:10.700
Well then…

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:17.760
They’ll see through you in an instant!

00:06:17.760 --> 00:06:18.980
Stop it.

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:32.980
Having a physical diagnosis is kind of meaningless…

00:06:33.430 --> 00:06:33.990
You lie.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:36.440
Attendance for the disciplinary squad is compulsory.

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:39.420
No matter how many times we’re examined, it is meaningless.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:41.330
Your chest measurement won’t get any bigger.

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:43.840
Oh, you shut up!

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:46.530
I don’t care. Natsuo hates big breasts.

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:49.370
If Natsuo is satisfied, that’s all I care about.

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:52.050
But Natsuo is gay.

00:06:52.380 --> 00:06:53.190
And serious.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:54.810
So what’s your point anyway??

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:56.380
I’m fine with it.

00:06:56.900 --> 00:07:01.150
With me as Natsuo’s lover… I will someday wake him from his haze!

00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:03.970
I will not lose the battle to anyone!

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:06.860
Even Musubi refuses to lose!

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:10.090
Those girls… they’re from the escape…

00:07:10.230 --> 00:07:13.070
Oh myyyy,  you girls are all late.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:18.200
I am number one!

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:20.080
