00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:47.340
Number one!

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:49.930
Number two!

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:53.160
Squabbling over something like THAT?

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:54.540
Pisses me off!

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:59.040
For all your self-righteous talk… you ARE insecure about it.

00:07:59.040 --> 00:07:59.700
