00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:29.810
It’s just that I won’t let them get away with their funny business THIS time.

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:32.270
I just wanna give them a little scare.

00:08:32.890 --> 00:08:34.410
As the disciplinary squad, you know?

00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:37.960
