00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:07.230
That’s S&M… That’s DEFINITELY S&M…!

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:09.400
Ka…Karasuba?

00:09:09.490 --> 00:09:13.340
The disciplinary squad…is at play

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:19.410
Well…well, Karasuba doesn’t have much practical fighting experience, so it’s not really in her.

00:09:19.510 --> 00:09:23.040
