00:12:56.920 --> 00:13:03.050
Yeah. They say just for a day, they’ll let an Ashikabi go to their rec. center.

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:07.890
And apparently I can also bring along any Sekirei friends I have.

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:10.660
Ohhhh. I didn’t know they had a recreation facility.

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:13.430
I hear they’ve even got meals and a hot spring.

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:16.940
