00:13:30.520 --> 00:13:35.370
Wow I had no idea there was a place like this in Shin Toteito…

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:40.060
It’s a private beach of MBI. Trespassing by outsiders is prohibited.

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:44.370
