00:19:18.610 --> 00:19:21.990
Tsukuimi-San, is that payback from earlier?

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:25.180
I knew it, these boobs are perfect!

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:26.620
Yukari-san, what are you doing here?

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:28.170
What about YOU, Musubi-tan?

00:19:30.590 --> 00:19:32.910
The Sekirei plan is a secret, isn’t it.

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:36.640
Minato-san will be teased.

00:19:38.090 --> 00:19:40.890
Ma~ma~, don’t worry about minor details.

00:19:41.130 --> 00:19:42.170
Good point.

00:19:50.090 --> 00:19:53.070
Yukari-san’s voice… I hope everything is okay.

00:19:53.480 --> 00:19:55.400
I hope she’s not bothering people.

00:19:58.030 --> 00:19:59.730
This feels so great!

00:20:01.830 --> 00:20:03.500
Sounds lively in there

00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:06.010
Now it’s time for round two of the competition!

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:06.800
I win that one!

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:09.450
Okay, this time, we’re competing on SHAPE.

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:10.630
Let the battle commence!

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:14.920
Oh, Tsukiumi-San, looking at you close, you’ve got really pretty ones!

00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:17.290
You bastard, where do you think you’re touching?

00:20:17.470 --> 00:20:19.790
Wh-What are they doing, I wonder?

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:27.520
That reminds me. I wonder if Kagari just isn’t coming…

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:36.340
Men’s bath… Women’s bath…which one should I enter?

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:44.860
Kinda noisy in there. Kind of defeats the purpose of a relaxing vacation.

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:46.710
It’s not a relaxing vacation.

00:20:47.170 --> 00:20:51.410
It’s just that with no missions and no battles, you have nowhere else to do.

00:20:51.530 --> 00:20:52.420
Shut UP!

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:54.330
And they all ran away from me anyway.

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:58.300
At this rate, they’ll just get more mad at me.

00:21:01.480 --> 00:21:02.600
Come back here, Musubi!

00:21:08.980 --> 00:21:09.960
You’re not getting away!

00:21:10.590 --> 00:21:12.440
Oh…they’re here.

00:21:13.150 --> 00:21:16.300
You really shouldn’t be running around while bathing!

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:18.280
How can I BATHE in these conditions?

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:21.050
I am shivering with RAGE. Come back, Musubi!

00:21:21.490 --> 00:21:22.720
No way!

00:21:22.570 --> 00:21:23.670
Musubi!

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:26.990
Hang in there!

00:21:29.490 --> 00:21:31.270
They’re really lively in there

00:21:31.280 --> 00:21:33.370
I guess it’s a mess as usual…

00:21:38.470 --> 00:21:42.160
But I’m glad they’re all having a good time.

00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:49.890
Those jerks… I swear… THEY’RE DEAD!

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:52.250
Not again…

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:55.230
SEVERE EARTHQUAKE!

00:22:10.240 --> 00:22:11.400
Well. Never mind.

00:22:20.100 --> 00:22:22.470
It’s so quiet today I’m almost lonely.

00:22:28.880 --> 00:22:32.590
But it’s nice to be alone just the two of us sometimes.

00:22:36.440 --> 00:22:37.420
Takehito-san

00:24:17.030 --> 00:24:20.760
Before the new series begins, let’s all speculate on what it will hold.

00:24:20.960 --> 00:24:23.020
Minato-san, Musubi has been thinking.

00:24:23.520 --> 00:24:25.560
The Sekirei Plan, Food Competition Arc!

00:24:25.970 --> 00:24:28.960
The competition will be how high we can pile curry onto a plate.

00:24:28.960 --> 00:24:31.320
That doesn’t exactly sound like a cooking competition to me…

00:24:31.320 --> 00:24:33.250
Weak. That’s weak, Musubi!

00:24:33.630 --> 00:24:37.330
The new series will be a Tokimeki Memorial between myself and Mina…

00:24:38.410 --> 00:24:39.160
You’re wrong!

00:24:39.500 --> 00:24:43.450
We’ll all go on a picnic together, and chase after a white bunny!

00:24:43.510 --> 00:24:46.510
But Kuu-chan, isn’t that Alice in Won…

00:24:46.510 --> 00:24:50.230
No, no, if you ask MATSU what she thinks, I think we’re going to search for Atlantis.

00:24:50.560 --> 00:24:52.020
And there we will find…

00:24:52.020 --> 00:24:54.150
Errrrgh, what a bother.

00:24:54.150 --> 00:24:55.780
Scavenger hunts are a drag.

00:24:56.000 --> 00:24:58.810
How about a Sekirei strip ‘n’ kill show?

00:24:58.810 --> 00:25:01.310
Kazehana, that can’t be televised…

00:25:02.190 --> 00:25:06.480
How about that? We strive for the top of the night?

00:25:06.480 --> 00:25:09.370
Woah, guys, you’re not getting it!

00:25:09.370 --> 00:25:11.960
Then maybe Sahashi-chan turns into a woman?

00:25:12.320 --> 00:25:15.150
In that case, we can gain some new viewers.

00:25:15.240 --> 00:25:17.940
And then there can be some nice lesbian Yuri action as well.

00:25:18.640 --> 00:25:25.540
Oh really? But I heard that it was going to be about a certain someone coming home in the rain.

00:25:25.580 --> 00:25:30.910
I’m home, honey! Come to think of it, I wonder if Kaoru has become a normal human yet?

00:25:31.250 --> 00:25:34.350
If not then maybe a ghost can come to his house…

00:25:34.560 --> 00:25:37.050
That’s scary on many levels!

00:25:37.440 --> 00:25:38.480
Then maybe get them closer?

00:25:38.860 --> 00:25:40.630
Seo Kaoru goes on a world cruise!

00:25:40.740 --> 00:25:42.670
Around the world in 1000 days. How does that sound?

00:25:42.760 --> 00:25:44.890
We can keep up the show for one to two years on that!

00:25:44.890 --> 00:25:47.470
But with YOU as the main character, the fanbase would disappear

00:25:47.480 --> 00:25:48.990
quickly and the show would be canceled.

00:25:48.990 --> 00:25:53.250
Don’t worry, Hikari, we won’t take a gamble like that.

00:25:53.300 --> 00:25:55.430
Oh really? Oh well then

00:25:56.900 --> 00:25:57.900
To-ho-ho.

00:25:58.040 --> 00:26:03.070
So I suppose next time it will still be a moe-moe comedy Yukari and shiina.

00:26:03.160 --> 00:26:06.950
Um, Yukari-san, you’ve changed the main title…

00:26:07.170 --> 00:26:09.550
Higa-sama, it’s about the new series.

00:26:09.550 --> 00:26:13.590
For the Kakizaki fans, how about me singing and dancing?

00:26:13.720 --> 00:26:18.720
However, fans of YOU in the Hanazawa world? I don’t think they exist.

00:26:19.390 --> 00:26:20.900
You speak with such harsh cruelty.

00:26:20.900 --> 00:26:26.530
I personally think a business drama filled with risk and intrigue is the way to go.

00:26:26.530 --> 00:26:28.210
Nah, that’s too boring.

00:26:28.720 --> 00:26:33.990
How about I am bestowed with a quest to travel the world in search of a special sword?

00:26:33.990 --> 00:26:42.040
But if you’re gonna go THERE, then why not a story about me sailing the world to defeat evil??

00:26:42.170 --> 00:26:43.910
Hey, retard. You stay quiet.

00:26:43.910 --> 00:26:46.020
WHAT did you say, you little shit??

00:26:46.520 --> 00:26:49.130
Now we’re not even on the topic of Sekirei anymore!

00:26:49.130 --> 00:26:51.000
Who the hell ARE you guys anyway?

00:26:50.700 --> 00:26:53.660
Well then, how about you three on the disciplinary squad?

00:26:53.720 --> 00:26:54.920
What do you think is good?

00:26:55.180 --> 00:26:57.550
Oh, you mean us?

00:26:57.780 --> 00:27:04.490
The mysterious beautiful girl, Beni Tsubasa, falls in passionate love with Natsuo.

00:27:04.580 --> 00:27:08.250
And just when things are going well, Beni Tsubasa’s memory starts to

00:27:08.250 --> 00:27:11.110
return and she finds out they MIGHT be brother-sister!

00:27:11.110 --> 00:27:19.110
And then, Natsuo gets seriously angered, and in a passionate rage, he destroys Beni Tsubasa with his beam.

00:27:19.110 --> 00:27:21.470
Hey, I didn’t ask YOU for input!

00:27:21.670 --> 00:27:26.180
Isn’t it an apocalyptic tale of the world’s end?

00:27:26.470 --> 00:27:29.470
That also sounds interesting, Karasuba.

00:27:29.470 --> 00:27:32.170
G-Guys! Can’t you take this a little more seriously?

00:27:32.170 --> 00:27:34.090
Goodness, you guys are too noisy.

00:27:34.540 --> 00:27:38.080
How about a lovely story about a beautiful woman making a baby?

00:27:38.080 --> 00:27:41.300
MOM, you too? And what do you mean “making a baby”?

00:27:42.230 --> 00:27:43.130
Oops, I spoke wrong.

00:27:43.410 --> 00:27:45.040
I meant RAISE a baby. RAISE a baby.

00:27:45.080 --> 00:27:48.640
Hearing your own mother talk about something like that is bit of a stretch.

00:27:49.000 --> 00:27:53.110
Then why don’t we all fight twin-beasts??

00:27:53.380 --> 00:27:57.940
Those that are CALLED heroes are defeated one after another by the beasts!

00:27:58.320 --> 00:28:00.860
Until the final hope, I…

00:28:00.570 --> 00:28:04.210
WHY?? Why does the main character have to keep changing??

00:28:04.210 --> 00:28:06.610
Then, what about you,  Minato-san? What kind of series would you like to see?

00:28:06.780 --> 00:28:08.610
She’s right, Minato!

00:28:08.610 --> 00:28:10.270
Tell us now!

00:28:10.440 --> 00:28:15.710
Um… How about searching for the perfect curry-bread?

00:28:16.630 --> 00:28:18.790
Sekirei. Pure Engagement.

00:28:19.170 --> 00:28:21.510
First Wing: Quiet Omen

00:28:21.980 --> 00:28:24.250
Starting with the next episode.

00:28:24.520 --> 00:28:27.020
Onii-chan, I hope there’s curry bread too!

00:28:28.440 --> 00:28:29.940
Sorry about that.
